%% MaterialsPanel on the subject workspace (frontend/src/components).
flowchart TD
  Panel["MaterialsPanel on /school/$subject"] --> LocalList["Local user files, links and notes"]
  LocalList --> CRUD["Add / edit / archive / delete / restore"]
  CRUD --> Local["Browser storage (AppDataProvider)<br/>CURRENT - FRONTEND"]
